,{},"; when you do not need the card and pagination, use ",[264,272,261],{}," directly.",[275,276,278],"h2",{"id":277},"usage","Usage",[280,281,283],"h3",{"id":282},"server-side-pagination","Server-side pagination",[254,285,286,287,290,291,294,295,298,299,302,303,306],{},"Pagination is handled by the back end: the component emits ",[264,288,289],{},"page-change",", and the page updates ",[264,292,293],{},"page"," and ",[264,296,297],{},"data"," after the query for that page succeeds. It is not emitted while loading, or when the page is the current one or out of range. ",[264,300,301],{},"interactionDisabled"," is ",[264,304,305],{},"true"," while loading and can be used to disable actions in the list.",[308,309],"component-example",{"name":310},"list-card-basic",[254,312,313,314,317,318,321,322,325,326,330],{},"The ",[264,315,316],{},"PageRequest"," type can be imported from ",[264,319,320],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Ftypes\u002Fpagination","; see ",[258,323,72],{"href":324},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fadvanced\u002Fauto-imports#types",". For the full pattern with query fields, see ",[258,327,329],{"href":328},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#with-listcard","With ListCard"," on ShuoQueryCard.",[280,332,334],{"id":333},"title-and-icon","Title and icon",[254,336,337,340,341,344,345,321,348,352],{},[264,338,339],{},"title"," is the title text and ",[264,342,343],{},"icon"," is the icon to the left of the title; pass an empty string to hide the icon. The title bar wraps by the same rules as ",[264,346,347],{},"ShuoQueryCard",[258,349,351],{"href":350},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#long-titles","Long titles",".",[308,354],{"name":355},"list-card-title",[280,357,359],{"id":358},"pagination-and-counts","Pagination and counts",[254,361,362,365,366,369,370,373],{},[264,363,364],{},"show-pagination"," controls the pagination at the bottom left, shown even with a single page; ",[264,367,368],{},"show-summary"," controls the count and range at the bottom right; ",[264,371,372],{},"page-size"," is the number of rows per page, 10 by default.",[308,375],{"name":376},"list-card-footer",[378,379,380,394],"ul",{},[381,382,383,384,386,387,321,390,352],"li",{},"After changing ",[264,385,372],{},", query again from the first page with ",[264,388,389],{},"getPagination(1)",[258,391,393],{"href":392},"#re-querying-the-current-page","Re-querying the current page",[381,395,396,397,400,401,403],{},"When both pagination and the summary are off, the bottom only shows ",[264,398,399],{},"#footer","; without ",[264,402,399],{},", there is no bottom area.",[280,405,407],{"id":406},"loading-and-empty-data","Loading and empty data",[254,409,410,411,414,415,418,419,422,423,352],{},"When the component is created while loading with no data, skeleton rows are shown; when re-querying with existing data, the data fades and switches with a height transition. ",[264,412,413],{},"empty"," is the empty-data text, using the table default when not set; with ",[264,416,417],{},"transition"," set to ",[264,420,421],{},"false",", no transition plays. The behavior is the same as ",[258,424,261],{"href":425},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Ftable#loading-and-empty-data",[308,427],{"name":428},"list-card-states",[254,430,431,432,294,435,438,439,442,443,352],{},"The title \"Results\" and the bottom summary switch with the locale (\"Results\" and \"Showing 1 to 10 of 25 results.\" in English, \"查詢結果\" and its summary in Traditional Chinese), and can be overridden globally with the ",[264,433,434],{},"listCard.title",[264,436,437],{},"listCard.summary"," texts; \"Loading…\" and \"No data\" belong to the ",[264,440,441],{},"table"," group. See ",[258,444,47],{"href":445},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages",[275,447,449],{"id":448},"examples","Examples",[280,451,453],{"id":452},"title-bar-actions-and-footer-content","Title bar actions and footer content",[254,455,456,459,460,463,464,466,467,294,469,471,472,474],{},[264,457,458],{},"#title"," replac